{title: The LORD Bless You and Keep You}
{subtitle: Numbers 6:24–26}
{key: Eb}
{tempo: 65}
{time: 3/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Eb] | [Eb] | [Eb] | [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
The LORD bless you [Bb]and keep [Cm][Abmaj7]you
The [Eb]LORD make [Bb]his face shine [Cm]on you
[Abmaj7]And be gracious to [Ab]you
The [Eb]LORD look [Bb]upon you with [Ab]favor
And give you [Eb]peace
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
The LORD [Bb]bless you and keep [Cm]you
The [Ab]LORD bless you and [Eb]keep you
[Bb]And give you peace
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Cm]The LORD [Abmaj7]bless you and keep [Ab]you
The [Eb]LORD make [Bb]his face shine on [Ab]you [Eb]
